<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>陳宥任｜學習歷程檔案</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Noto Sans TC", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd, #ffffff);
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1565c0, #1976d2);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 17px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 28px 20px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .card a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #1565c0;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .card p {
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #666;
        }

        /* QR Code */
        .qrcode-section {
            margin: 45px auto 20px;
            background: white;
            max-width: 360px;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .qrcode-section h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            color: #1565c0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .qrcode-section img {
            width: 220px;
            height: 220px;
            object-fit: contain;
            display: block;
            margin: 15px auto;
        }

        .qrcode-section p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                padding: 40px 15px;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .container {
                margin: 20px auto;
                padding: 15px;
            }

            .qrcode-section img {
                width: 190px;
                height: 190px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>新北高中 陳宥任</h1>
    <p>高中生學習歷程檔案｜讀書計畫與成長紀錄</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="card-grid">

        <div class="card">
            <a href="competition.html">🏆 競賽經驗</a>
            <p>參與校內外競賽，培養問題解決與實作能力。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="activities.html">🌟 課外活動</a>
            <p>拓展視野，累積多元學習與團隊合作經驗。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="leadership.html">👑 幹部經驗</a>
            <p>擔任班級與校內幹部，培養領導與溝通能力。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="club.html">🎵 社團經驗</a>
            <p>透過社團活動探索興趣與培養責任感。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="ask.html">📚 多元選修課程｜字典</a>
            <p>選修跨領域課程，強化專業與探索未來方向。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="stock.html">📈 多元選修課程｜查詢股價</a>
            <p>輸入股票代號，例如 2330，查詢股票相關資訊。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <a href="ai.html">🤖 AI 應用</a>
            <p>結合人工智慧工具，提升學習效率與創作能力。</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- QR Code -->
    <div class="qrcode-section">

        <h2>📱 我的學習歷程</h2>

        <img
            src="qrcode-generator.png"
            alt="陳宥任學習歷程 QR Code"
        >

        <p>掃描 QR Code 查看我的學習歷程網站</p>

    </div>

</div>

<footer>
    © 2026 陳宥任 學習歷程檔案
</footer>

</body>
</html>
